#==============================================================================================
#
#   css_transition - CSS::CSSTransition: an animation started by a change of a transitioned
#                    property
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/CSS/CSSTransition.cpp (lines 1-177) with the inline members of
#       CSSTransition.h, by region p4a: starting a transition (a CSSTransition with a two-
#       keyframe KeyframeEffect on the element, registered with it and played), its property,
#       animation class and composite order, its start and end times and values, and the
#       output of its timing function at a time. CSSTransition's private constructor, which
#       does the work, is css_transition_construct.
